{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的自动续跑插件，在宿主会话事件流中监听轮次结束，并通过设置页和 HTTP API 管理规则。它会在传输错误、崩溃中断或输出截断时，按有序规则重发续跑提示；限流可退避，额度或鉴权失败可停止通知，上下文超限可尝试压缩，规则也可指定备用模型。插件还提供每会话重试上限、冷却时间和活动日志。适合希望失败后自动恢复会话并在 Web 设置页调整策略的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js 22.5 及以上和 DSH 0.1.7-rc.2 及以上；无需额外密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:787-820","src/index.js:823-905","src/index.js:78-96","package.json:22-32"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue resumes DSH Web sessions after errors, interrupted turns, or truncation. Ordered rules support backoff, stop notices, context compaction, and model switching. A settings panel edits policies and shows activity. Requires Node.js 22.5+ and DSH 0.1.7-rc.2+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:787-820","src/index.js:823-905","src/index.js:78-96","package.json:22-32"]}
