{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#feature-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 的功能「失败后续跑」：监听会话轮次结束，在传输错误、崩溃中断或输出截断时按规则向同一会话投递续跑提示。它通过指数退避、冷却和尝试上限控制再次发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:352-377","src/index.js:653-680"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#feature-2","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 的功能「按失败类型执行规则」：默认规则可对限流退避续跑、对额度和鉴权失败停止并通知、对上下文超限尝试压缩。用户可调整规则顺序和动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:78-85","src/index.js:352-377","src/index.js:615-648"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#feature-3","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 的功能「续跑时切换模型」：规则可指定 provider 和 model，自动续跑启动的新轮次会应用该选择，让用户在主模型失败时配置备用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:374-377","src/index.js:792-820"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#feature-4","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 的功能「Web 设置和活动记录」：设置页展示开关、规则及会话尝试信息，并可编辑续跑参数；宿主 API 提供状态、模型目录和设置更新，活动事件写入本地 JSONL 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.js:593-606","src/index.js:823-905","src/index.js:503-505"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-continue#caveat-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-continue","commit":"78a08d05b10a288bb30ace7408556e68113d0a7d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-continue 使用前须知：上下文超限时，只有宿主提供压缩服务且压缩成功才会续跑；服务缺失或无可压缩区间时会停止并通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:615-648"]}
